<section class="bsw-definition" aria-labelledby="bsw-definition-heading">
  <div class="bsw-definition__inner">
    <div class="bsw-definition__intro">
      <p class="bsw-definition__eyebrow">The basics</p>
      <h2 id="bsw-definition-heading" class="bsw-definition__heading">
        What is a barbershop website<span class="bsw-definition__period">?</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="bsw-definition__answer">
        A barbershop website gives clients one place to see your services, prices, team, opening
        hours and location — and book an appointment if you offer online booking. On your own domain,
        it gives your shop a recognisable home beyond social profiles and booking apps.
      </p>

      <p class="bsw-definition__support">
        Show clients the shop and people behind the booking button.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bsw-definition__contrast">
      <dl class="bsw-definition__concepts">
        <div class="bsw-definition-concept bsw-definition-concept--profile">
          <dt class="bsw-definition-concept__label">A booking profile</dt>
          <dd class="bsw-definition-concept__text">A booking-first page, with features that vary by provider.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="bsw-definition-concept bsw-definition-concept--website">
          <dt class="bsw-definition-concept__label">Your barbershop website</dt>
          <dd class="bsw-definition-concept__text">
            <span class="bsw-definition-concept__line">Your services, team and location —</span>
            <span class="bsw-definition-concept__line">with a way to book.</span>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p class="bsw-definition__note">Both can work together. Features vary between providers.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
